            <ArticleTitle>The hidden antral compartment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>463-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two patients with rare isolated posterior antral compartments are presented. In both cases, the radiologist directed the surgeon to these clinically hidden recesses. The radiographic appearance included a walled-off compartment filled with material of soft-tissue density; clinical importance is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
